# Gemini API key used by the client app.
#
# At build time Vite's `define` (see vite.config.ts) substitutes this value into
# `process.env.API_KEY`, so the compiled bundle — and therefore the packaged
# Android APK — can call the Gemini API out of the box without any runtime
# configuration or GitHub Actions secrets.
#
# SECURITY NOTE: a client-side key is embedded inside the published APK and can
# be extracted by anyone who downloads it. Keep this key restricted in Google AI
# Studio (e.g. an app-restricted / development-only key) and proxy requests
# through a backend for production use.
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSyCts7NuiqtwiRwtHuIcNEPJN_xs5ApRVFs
